            "text": "<h2>Our Mission</h2><p>We believe your car is more than transportation — it's an extension of who you are. DriveStack exists to help you express that through premium accessories that look great, last long, and install easily.</p><p>From ambient LED lighting to precision-fit organizers, everything in our catalog is chosen with one question: would we put this in our own car?</p><p>If the answer isn't a confident yes, it doesn't make the cut.</p>",
